    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=633779857901224535&sectionId=633779858001887831)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRPpiSXaPs_text","label":"ggRPpiSXaPs_text","default":"<p>Children have an incredible imagination. A simple piece of paper can become a magical world, a drawing of their family, their favorite animal, a dream house, or an idea that only they can explain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those drawings may start as crayons on paper, but they can become much more than that. With Memobrick, you can transform a child's artwork into a personalized brick mosaic that they can actually build and see come to life.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/1652811d-c114-4628-a655-fc5a54afbd38.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_alt","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_alt","default":"Memobrick Kid Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_title","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_title","default":"Memobrick Kid Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSeUar_tlt_text","label":"ggSeUar_tlt_text","default":"<p>Children do not need complicated tools to create something amazing. Give them some paper and crayons, and they can turn their imagination into an entirely new world.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A child might draw a superhero, their dream car, their family, a favorite pet, or even an imaginary creature.</p><p>To adults, it might look like a simple drawing. To a child, it can represent an entire story.</p><p>That is what makes children's artwork so special.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI39i-YCIt_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggI39i-YCIt_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/67976656-245b-4412-a3da-178b8732b366.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI39i-YCIt_alt","label":"ggI39i-YCIt_alt","default":"Memobrick Kid Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI39i-YCIt_title","label":"ggI39i-YCIt_title","default":"Memobrick Kid Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYZeJATo1-_text","label":"ggYZeJATo1-_text","default":"Turn Their Drawing Into Something They Can Build"},{"type":"html","id":"gginLjfrm9r_text","label":"gginLjfrm9r_text","default":"<p>As children grow, their artwork changes along with them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The simple drawings they create when they are young eventually become more detailed pictures, school projects, and creative hobbies. Saving some of those early creations gives parents a way to look back at how their child's imagination developed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But instead of keeping every drawing inside a box, why not choose one that deserves to be seen?</p><p>A favorite drawing can become a personalized keepsake that reminds your family of a particular stage of childhood.</p>"}],
